  "details": "~Repro steps~\n`1.) Swap into a large avatar (large enough for the camera scaling to be noticeable)`\n`2.) Pull camera out and detach lens from camera`\n`3.) Swap back into avatar of regular height`\nCamera lens will retain it's previous scaling until a restart of the client. Note that this also occurs with small avatars as well. This issue seems to only occur if you swap avatars of noticeable height difference while the lens is detached.\nVideo: https://streamable.com/w7324k",
